  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SALO Zimbabwe- South Africa solidarity on Human rights 2021-2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is Greater regional support for a pro-reform South African intervention to address the crisis in Zimbabwe and the overall objective is that Relevant Southern African international relations role players are well-informed about events in Zimbabwe and well-placed to exert strong and positive influence on the Zimbabwe crisis. 

SALO&#x2019;s strategic outlook is underpinned by a commitment to human rights, gender participation and representation as well as cooperation between Northern and Southern stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
